%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 207ddad3e1c90594ba3f48e2a5a6a796, type: 3}
  m_Name: 15.5 IvesTutorialAFterInsertion
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - bodyText: In two-player combat clashing rules are slightly different.
    speakerName: Tutorial
    displayingImage: {fileID: -2991674613422419996, guid: 1e6cf2fca7138174e8f34bd44807fdc0, type: 3}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: Playing an Action on the enemy itself (rather than on the Icon like
      we did just now), will form a clash only if the enemy is targetting you back.
    speakerName: Tutorial
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6f8ab552348e73941b245fe9ca454974, type: 3}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: 'Ealier, if Ives had played the Action on the enemy itself, it would
      have been an unopposed attack. '
    speakerName: Tutorial
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3fea2e94140c08246a0e502ee92d3761, type: 3}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: If Jackie had played the Action on the enemy itself, it would have
      been a clash. Because both Jackie and the enemy targeted each other.
    speakerName: Tutorial
    displayingImage: {fileID: -2991674613422419996, guid: 1e6cf2fca7138174e8f34bd44807fdc0, type: 3}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: Feel free to try the combinations out by retrieving your card from
      the queue.
    speakerName: Tutorial
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6f8ab552348e73941b245fe9ca454974, type: 3}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: 'Feel free to visit the glossary in the pause menu should you need
      a refresher on key game mechanics. '
    speakerName: Tutorial
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ce77eb358f2d54544adbd71c03209471, type: 3}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: "And remember, we still can\u2019t play Actions with overlapping Speeds."
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 87cb7c6c6588a4a3a957b707239abbf0, type: 3}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: "In a crowded fight, stepping into each other\u2019s timing can be
      fatal."
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 87cb7c6c6588a4a3a957b707239abbf0, type: 3}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: "Alright Jackie, let\u2019s crush these bugs!"
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8dca0cf7dcae9ae4c831743a3edfdbbc, type: 3}
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
